Package: daner
Title: Helpers for Working with DANE Data
Version: 0.0.2
Authors@R: person("edalfon", email = "edalfon@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Helpers for working with data published by DANE (Departamento
    Administrativo Nacional de Estadistica, Colombia's national statistics
    agency). Provides functions to standardize and join DIVIPOLA
    political-administrative division codes, parse DDI (Data Documentation
    Initiative) XML metadata published alongside DANE's microdata catalogs,
    and ingest the zipped SPSS files DANE distributes.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/edalfon/daner
BugReports: https://github.com/edalfon/daner/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
